    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By flagging Key legal risks that we should flag and emphasizing our company's experience and compliance measures, our company's can provide a robust and compliant offer that meets the client's requirements and satisfies all relevant regulatory frameworks." ;
